  "_doc": "Shared parity fixture for the connector-mating compatibility matrix (plan 2026-06-12 §4.3). Read by BOTH frontend connectorCompat.test.ts and backend tests/optical/test_connector_compat.py so the two implementations can never drift. `out` = the feeding (source) connector, `in` = the receiving connector. Pure enum/string logic — no float tolerance. expected.codes is order-independent (tests sort).",
